        \end{align*}
        where both $d_{ \ell_2,\dots, \ell_{i-1}} (\tau_0)$ and $\tilde d_{ \ell_2,\dots, \ell_{i-1}} (\tau_0)$ are polynomials of $w_2(\tau_0),\dots w_{i-1}(\tau_0)$.
       Now, using 
