   &+ B^2e^{(3-2\mu)\tau}C(\frac{\mu\mathtt{a_1}}{2{\bf{n}_{\mu}}-\mu})^{-1}e^{-\frac{\mu\mathtt{a_1}}{2{\bf{n}_{\mu}}-\mu}\tau_0}\\
